{"parse": {"title": "Chest (alchemist's signet)", "pageid": 594623, "revid": 15329879, "redirects": [], "wikitext": {"*": "{{Infobox Scenery\n|version1 = Closed\n|version2 = Open\n|name = Chest\n|image1 = [[File:Chest (Alchemist's signet, closed).png|280px]]\n|image2 = [[File:Chest (Alchemist's signet, open).png|280px]]\n|release = [[23 July]] [[2025]]\n|update = Varlamore: The Final Dawn Out Now\n|members = Yes\n|quest = No\n|location = [[Alchemical Society]]\n|options1 = Open\n|options2 = None\n|examine = I wonder what's inside...\n|map = {{Map|mtype=pin|mapID=-1|zoom=3|x=1394|y=9321|1386,9315}}\n|id1 = 56437\n|id2 = 56438\n|leagueRegion = Varlamore\n}}\nA '''chest''' containing [[Herblore]] supplies can be found in the basement of the [[Alchemical Society]] headquarters where [[Mastering Mixology]] is played. 60 [[Herblore]]{{Boostable|no}} is required to gain access to the basement. It can be opened using an [[alchemist's signet]], an uncommon drop from [[elder custodian stalker]]s. Opening the chest consumes the signet and grants four stacks of items.\n\nWhen opened, two messages will be displayed: {{Mes|The alchemist's signet fits perfectly into an indent on the chest, causing it to open...}}, and {{Mes|You take some loot from inside.}}.\n\n==Drops==\n{{DropLogProject|kills=118153}}\n\nOpening the chest grants four stacks of items:\n#One aldarium\n#Either a [[secondary]] or herb seed\n#One grimy herb from the [[useful herb drop table]] (avantoe, snapdragon, ranarr weed, torstol)\n#Two grimy herbs from the [[combat herb drop table]] (kwuarm, dwarf weed, cadantine, lantadyme)\n\n{{Average drop value|mobname=chest|killname=}}\n\n===100%===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Aldarium|quantity=1 (noted)|rarity=Always}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Secondaries & seeds===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Mort myre fungus|quantity=5-8 (noted)|rarity=5/25}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Snape grass|quantity=3-5 (noted)|rarity=5/25}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Wine of Zamorak|quantity=2-4 (noted)|rarity=3/25}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Harralander seed|quantity=2-3|rarity=3/25}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Irit seed|quantity=2-3|rarity=3/25}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Avantoe seed|quantity=2-3|rarity=3/25}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Toadflax seed|quantity=2-3|rarity=2/25}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Ranarr seed|quantity=1-2|rarity=1/25}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===One herb===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{UsefulHerbDropLines|1/1|1 (noted)}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Two herbs===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{CombatHerbDropLines|1/1|2 (noted)}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}"}}, "fetchedAt": "2026-10-06T04:21:58.372550+00:00", "dropHtml": "<table class=\"wikitable sortable filterable item-drops autosort=4,a\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"border-right: none;\" class=\"drops-img-header drop-disp-btn unsortable\" title=\"Sort items by category, rarity and name.\"></th>\n<th style=\"border-left: none;\" class=\"item-col\">Item</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Quantity</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th class=\"ge-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th>\n<th class=\"alch-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">High Alch</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td class=\"inventory-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Aldarium\" title=\"Aldarium\"><img alt=\"Aldarium.png: Chest (alchemist&#39;s signet) drops Aldarium with rarity Always in quantity 1 (noted)\" src=\"/images/Aldarium.png?7f77f\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"30\" /></a></span></td><td class=\"item-col\" style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/w/Aldarium\" title=\"Aldarium\">Aldarium</a></td><td data-sort-value=\"1\">1&#160;<span class=\"dropsline-noted\">(noted)</span></td><td data-sort-value=\"1\" class=\"table-bg-blue\"><span>Always</span></td><td data-sort-value=\"47754\" class=\"ge-column\" title=\"47,754 coins\" style=\"text-align: